    "A domain match proves nothing on its own, because From can be forged. Treat it as evidence of legitimacy only with trusted DKIM/DMARC alignment; without that, use the registry to detect impersonation.",
    "Every verified_statements quote was checked word for word on its source page on 2026-09-29. One search summary had attributed a statement to the wrong Agricultural Bank page; it was removed.",
    "Domains and service numbers were confirmed on each organization's own site (homepage title, contact page or site-restricted search) on 2026-09-29.",
    "source_type media means a news page quoting police or the organization; the issuer field names who is quoted. scope marks statements limited to one region.",
    "display_names are the only names matched against a From display name: specific brand names, without ambiguous acronyms (ABC, BOC, EMS, QQ) or words that also name other entities (中通, 南航, 社保, 海关). Government entries list gov.cn in gov_suffixes, because local offices send from their own gov.cn subdomains.",
    "2026-10-07 从业主的常用网站清单补入：携程、去哪儿网、同程旅行、美团、抖音、哔哩哔哩、爱奇艺、小米账号按名称匹配；滴滴出行与唯品会只核验自己域名的邮件（sender_only），因为它们面向用户的发件域名没有页面说明。每个域名都有官方页面写明的服务、投诉或举报邮箱。饿了么没有找到任何官方邮箱，未列入。",
    "2026-10-07 补入清单中其余的中国服务：快手、小红书、菜鸟、百度、货拉拉、德邦快递、芒果TV、酷狗音乐、蜜雪冰城、叮咚买菜、瑞幸咖啡按名称匹配；微博、知乎只核验自己域名的邮件。未列入：哈啰（官网无法从此处访问）、得物（访问被跳转到国际版）、喜马拉雅、豆瓣、高德（现行页面只有电话）、大众点评（邮件域名没有页面说明）、优酷与盒马（举报邮箱在阿里巴巴的共享域名）、网易云音乐（客服使用免费 163 邮箱）、钉钉、飞书、闲鱼、BOSS直聘（转发他人的内容）、肯德基中国、饿了么、华为、苏宁易购（未找到或未能核对官方邮箱）。"
